@AgenticV @GS_VCactivist @VaibhavSisinty For agentic coding, it is not just the model it is harness too, and also what you put in AGENTS.md and there engineering practice comes into advantage compare to vibe coders. On other tasks like web design, Deepseek beats astra and fable 5.1 for example. So the simple answer is depends on which task.  Also those smaller models you can run on 2-3 DGX sparks and get constant 60-90 tokens per second. Also if you look a bit back GLM 5.2 give the same level of inteligence like Opus 4.8 and it came out 2 WEEKS after opus with the same inteligence levels for me that is on pair. the gap is so small, in the past chinese labs used distilation because they had a huge gap, nowdays they are releasing models with the gap of 2-6 weeks behind USA SOTA. On top of that when you add intentional nerfing/fallback from antropic and openai in practice you are getting same or worse comparing to chinese models.

